[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
5BSD Instruments is installed as an account-independent capability bundle.
From a root administrator login with switchboard discovery, register the
intended desktop account, using that account's actual runtime directory:

  %%PREFIX%%/sbin/5bsd-instruments-register register --user USER \
    --runtime-dir /var/run/user/UID --wayland-display wayland-0

For X11, use --display :0 and optionally --xauthority /home/USER/.Xauthority.
Then launch 5bsd-instruments from that user's desktop session.
The current System bundle supports one registered desktop account per host.
The base must contain the system.Network.PF endpoint and working BSDTrace.
EOM
}
]
